{"pageid": 815, "title": "Teddy", "revid": 1833, "categories": ["Characters", "Totems", "Monsters", "Phantasmatypes", "Characters (HOS comics)", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Teddy</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8b/Teddy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241216160820\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Teddy\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8b/Teddy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241216160820\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8b/Teddy.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241216160820 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/8/8b/Teddy.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241216160820 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Teddy\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Teddy.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Teddy.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phantasmatypes\">Phantasmatype</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">Totem</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Relationships</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_25\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 25\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #25</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\">Don't mind Teddy. He's a real shit, and I think he's gone half mad.</div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—<a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a> , <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #11</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Teddy</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasmatypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Phantasmatypes\">Phantasmatype</a> monster bound to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a>. It is currently unknown what kind of monster Teddy was before being trapped and bound to his master, but he serves as a <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">totem</a> for him and sits on his desk. Teddy is described as \"half-mad\" and can often be heard eerily giggling.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>At some point, Teddy was bound to an initiate to the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> who would later become <a href=\"/wiki/The_Old_Dragon\" title=\"The Old Dragon\">The Old Dragon</a>. He would sit on the Dragon's desk<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and on meeting tables.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC5&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC5-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The Old Dragon describes him as a \"real shit\" who's gone half-mad.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC11&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC11-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_5\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 5\">Issue #5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_11\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 11\">Issue #11</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_2\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"8fd2b52deabe7fe52429c27ca4ed3aa0\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Teddy11-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:118px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Teddy11.png\" title=\"Teddy11.png (293 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:118px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/2/23/Teddy11.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/118?cb=20241223121738\" title=\"Teddy11.png (293 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #11.\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Teddy11.png\" data-image-key=\"Teddy11.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\".\"></noscript><img style=\"